  "description": "✨Welcome to my Store✨\nWestern CowGirl SVG PNG Bundle Design.\nThis is not t-shirt, digital downloadable files only.\nYou will receive 5 files\n– 1 SVG (Color)\n– 1 EPS (Color)\n– 1 PDF (Color)\n– 1 DXF (Color)\n– 1 PNG (Color) 300 dpi IN A FOLDER.\nThese high-quality files may be used with the Silhouette, Cricut, and other cutting tools.\nIdeal for a wide range of artistic projects, including t-shirts, cards, bags, mugs, stickers, and frame artwork.\n*Note: Due to variations in display settings, actual colors may differ somewhat. The image’s colors and quality may change depending on how you decide to print it.-To utilize these files, you’ll need a design/editing tool that supports SVG/EPS/PNG file types, as well as a computer to unzip them.\nThanks!\nHave a great day/night!\nBundleDesigner",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✨Welcome to my Store✨<br>\nWestern CowGirl SVG PNG Bundle Design.</p>\n<p>This is not t-shirt, digital downloadable files only.</p>\n<p>You will receive 5 files<br>\n– 1 SVG (Color)<br>\n– 1 EPS (Color)<br>\n– 1 PDF (Color)<br>\n– 1 DXF (Color)<br>\n– 1 PNG (Color) 300 dpi IN A FOLDER.</p>\n<p>These high-quality files may be used with the Silhouette, Cricut, and other cutting tools.<br>\nIdeal for a wide range of artistic projects, including t-shirts, cards, bags, mugs, stickers, and frame artwork.</p>\n<p>*Note: Due to variations in display settings, actual colors may differ somewhat. The image’s colors and quality may change depending on how you decide to print it.-To utilize these files, you’ll need a design/editing tool that supports SVG/EPS/PNG file types, as well as a computer to unzip them.</p>\n<p>Thanks!<br>\nHave a great day/night!<br>\nBundleDesigner</p>",
